<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids: Amphibians" id="001269ac" height="411" width="574" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="kidsWhite" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Algunos animales viven en el agua. Otros en la tierra. Los anfibios suelen pasar una parte de su vida en el agua y otra en la tierra. Las ranas, los sapos, las salamandras y los tritones son anfibios.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Anfibios&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid>1B823254,25A41E91,1B829974</imagerefid></caption><image>001269ac_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="268" y="361"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Salamandra&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>211</x><y>245</y></point><point><x>211</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>245</y></point><point><x>211</x><y>245</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Salamandra&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="264" y="362" w="87" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="56" y="361"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Tritón alpino&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>245</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>205</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>206</x><y>245</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>245</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Tritón alpino&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="52" y="362" w="97" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="104" y="225"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Rana arborícola de ojos rojos&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>237</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>236</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Rana arborícola de ojos rojos&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="100" y="226" w="207" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Anfibios&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="2" slideid="2"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;¿Cómo explicarías la diferencia entre una rana y un sapo? Las ranas tienen la piel lisa y las patas traseras largas para saltar. Por lo general, viven cerca del agua. Los sapos tienen la piel rugosa y las patas traseras cortas. Suelen vivir en lugares más secos.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;¿Rana o sapo?&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid>25A41224,25A4123D</imagerefid></caption><image>001269ac_2.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="256" y="1"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Rana arborícola&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>215</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>212</x><y>378</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>378</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>215</x><y>1</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Rana arborícola&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="252" y="2" w="115" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="62" y="1"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Sapo verde&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>373</y></point><point><x>202</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>203</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Sapo verde&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="58" y="2" w="84" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;¿Rana o sapo?&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="3" slideid="3"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Como la mayoría de los anfibios, las ranas ponen sus huevos en el agua. Los pequeños renacuajos salen del huevo y respiran debajo del agua como los peces. Los renacuajos no tardan en sufrir cambios sorprendentes. Les crecen las patas y pueden salir fuera del agua. Empiezan a respirar aire. Las colas se hacen más cortas y pronto desaparecen. Los renacuajos se han convertido en ranas.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;De renacuajo a rana&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid>1B8232A1,29D29279,29D2927A,29D2927B</imagerefid></caption><image>001269ac_3.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="73" y="170"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Huevos&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>183</y></point><point><x>205</x><y>184</y></point><point><x>206</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>183</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Huevos&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="69" y="171" w="58" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="277" y="170"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Renacuajo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>212</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>212</x><y>185</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>182</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>212</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Renacuajo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="273" y="171" w="80" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="28" y="359"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Desarrollo de las patas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>192</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>206</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>204</x><y>191</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>192</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Desarrollo de las patas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="24" y="360" w="162" h="17"/></label><label labelid="4" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="274" y="359"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><points/></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Rana joven&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>212</x><y>191</y></point><point><x>212</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>374</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>190</y></point><point><x>212</x><y>191</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Rana joven&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="270" y="360" w="85" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;De renacuajo a rana&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="4" slideid="4"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las salamandras son los únicos anfibios con colas largas. Si son atacadas por otro animal, algunas salamandras pueden desprenderse de la cola. ¡La cola se mueve y distrae al animal mientras la salamandra escapa! Con el tiempo, a la salamandra le crece una nueva cola.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Salamandras&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid>1B829978</imagerefid></caption><image>001269ac_4.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="152" y="1"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Salamandra roja&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>0</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>1</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Salamandra roja&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="148" y="2" w="119" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Salamandras&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="5" slideid="5"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las cecilias son los anfibios más extraños. No poseen brazos ni patas, y parecen lombrices de gran tamaño. También son ciegas. La mayoría de las cecilias vive bajo tierra en terrenos blandos, como los gusanos. Pero a diferencia de los gusanos, tienen huesos y dientes.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Anfibios raros&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid>1B829943</imagerefid></caption><image>001269ac_5.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="184" y="1"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Cecilia&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Cecilia&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="180" y="2" w="55" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Anfibios raros&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="4" textdividerbarcolorid="4" creditsbuttonstyleid="3" resetbuttonstyleid="4" navbuttonstyleid="1" numbermenu